 114:                 # flattener was corrected and MAVACAMTEN still rendered `bar:` because THIS
 115:                 # writer had baked the text into the object. If the two can hold different
 116:                 # maps they will drift, which is the two-locations problem that produced the
 117:                 # GRADE disagreement on 23 of 34 pooled outcomes.
 118:                 bits.append(_pp._lead_in(str(k), t))
